## 4. Key Business Engines & Services

We will build the following service components:

- **`pricingEngine.js`**: Server-side pricing helper calculating subtotal, surge pricing, flat/percent coupons, flat ₹29 convenience fee, and 18% GST on convenience fee only. Professional payout is 75% of service + addons price.
- **`dispatchEngine.js`**: Sequential dispatch matching coordinates and skills. Scores professionals using:
  `Score = (Distance × 0.30) + (Availability × 0.20) + (Skill × 0.15) + (Rating × 0.20) + (Reliability × 0.10) + (Workload × 0.05) × PriorityMultiplier`
  Fails over after 3 declines or 3-minute timeouts using a polling function.
- **`bookingStateMachine.js`**: Enforces transitions across the 18 states. Handles start OTP and complete OTP verification using bcrypt comparison.
- **`availabilityService.js`**: Aggregate availability querying weeklySchedule and existing booking windows, adding a 30-minute buffer window for travel time.
- **`cancellationService.js`**: Calculates refund percentage (>4h: 100%, <4h: 80%, <1h: 50% refund).

