## 5. Security & Validation Controls
- All sensitive input validated with **Zod**.
- Sensitive information (e.g. OTPs, passwords, PII, full Aadhaar/PAN) is excluded from log captures (`logger.js`).
- Database modifications on `AuditLog` are disabled at the Mongoose middleware level.
- Razorpay webhook verifies webhook signatures using `crypto.createHmac` on the raw incoming body.

